    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spirit Conclave",
    "summary": "Whenever an enemy unit destroys one of your ASURYANI PSYKER models, that enemy unit receives a Vengeful Dead token. Your WRAITH CONSTRUCT models get +1 to Hit and +1 to Wound when attacking a unit that holds at least one such token. Your ASURYANI PSYKER models also have Spirit Guides (Aura): your WRAITHBLADES, WRAITHGUARD and WRAITHLORD units within 12\" of such a model have Battle Focus.",
